  tool_gradient_fn_xy: 'f(x,y) = x·y',
  tool_gradient_fn_xy3y: 'f(x,y) = x²y + 3y',
  tool_gradient_formula_body: '∇f = (∂f/∂x₁, ∂f/∂x₂, …, ∂f/∂xₙ)。二元时：∇f(x,y) = (∂f/∂x, ∂f/∂y)。∇f 方向为最速上升；梯度下降则沿 −∇f 迈步。',
  tool_gradient_formula_item_1: '对每个变量求 ∂f/∂xᵢ，其余变量保持不变。',
