  tool_pythagorean_step_a_tpl: '直角边 a：a = √(c² − b²) = √({c}² − {b}²) = √({c2} − {b2}) = √{diff} = {a}。',
  tool_pythagorean_step_area_tpl: '直角三角形面积：Area = (a × b) ÷ 2 = ({a} × {b}) ÷ 2 = {area}。',
  tool_pythagorean_step_b_tpl: '直角边 b：b = √(c² − a²) = √({c}² − {a}²) = √({c2} − {a2}) = √{diff} = {b}。',
  tool_pythagorean_step_c_tpl: '斜边：c = √(a² + b²) = √({a}² + {b}²) = √({a2} + {b2}) = √{sum} = {c}。',
  tool_pythagorean_steps_title: '步骤',
  tool_pythagorean_title: '勾股定理计算器 — 求直角三角形未知边并写出平方验算',
